ve","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Tell me if you see the light move.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"أخبرني إذا رأيت الضوء يتحرك.","transliteration":"akh-bir-nee ee-thah rah-ay-ta ad-dow ya-ta-har-rak","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-look-nose","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Look at my nose.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"انظر إلى أنفي.","transliteration":"oon-zur ee-lah an-fee","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-double","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Do you see two of me?","linked_terms":[],"translation":"هل ترانِي اثنين؟","transliteration":"hal tah-rah-nee ith-nayn?","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-worse-direction","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Is it worse looking this way?","linked_terms":[],"translation":"هل يزداد سوءاً عند النظر هكذا؟","transliteration":"hal yaz-dad soo-an in-da an-na-zar hah-kah-thah?","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-pup-shine","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pupils","english":"I am going to shine a light in your eyes. Please look at the wall behind me.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"سأسلط ضوءاً على عينيك. انظر إلى الحائط خلفي.","transliteration":"sa-oo-sal-lit dow-an ah-lah ay-nayk. oon-zur ee-lah al-hah-it khal-fee","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-pup-dont-look-light","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pupils","english":"Do not look at the light. Keep looking far away.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"لا تنظر إلى الضوء، انظر إلى البعيد.","transliteration":"lah tan-zur ee-lah ad-dow, oon-zur ee-lah al-bah-eed","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-pup-both-open","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pupils","english":"Keep both eyes open.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"أبقِ كلتا عينيك مفتوحتين.","transliteration":"ab-kee kil-tah ay-nayk maf-too-ha-tayn","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-mot-look-here","field":"eye","stage":"eye-motility","english":"Look here.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"انظر هنا.","transliteration":"oon-zur hoo-nah","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-mot-finger","field":"eye","stage":"eye-motility","english":"Look at my finger. Do not move your head.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"انظر إلى إصبعي. لا تحرك رأسك.","transliteration":"oon-zur ee-lah is-bah-ee. lah too-har-rik rah-sak","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-mot-up","field":"eye","stage":"eye-motility","english":"Look up.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"انظر إلى الأعلى.","transliteration":"oon-zur ee-lah al-ah-lah","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-mot-down","field":"eye","stage":"eye-motility","english":"Look down.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"انظر إلى الأسفل.","transliteration":"oon-zur ee-lah al-as-fal","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-mot-left","field":"eye","stage":"eye-motility","english":"Look left.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"انظر إلى اليسار.","transliteration":"oon-zur ee-lah al-ya-sar","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-mot-right","field":"eye","stage":"eye-motility","english":"Look right.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"انظر إلى اليمين.","transliteration":"oon-zur ee-lah al-ya-meen","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-mot-straight","field":"eye","stage":"eye-motility","english":"Look straight ahead.","linked